  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In which of the following order the given complex ions are arranged correctly with respect to their decreasing spin only magnetic moment?<br />(i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(ii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>NiCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(iv) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
