  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Complex<br />(i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>FeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> is WFL</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0223_ef6fb351b5ac.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 57px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>(ii)<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Co</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Co</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Ar</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is SFL</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0223_abd7edf398bf.png\" style=\"width: 196px; height: 60px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>(iii) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>NiCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Ar</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>WFL</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0223_b16e8f9e4bd4.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 52px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>8</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>(iv)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Ar</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>SFL</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0223_40ec665b46ba.png\" style=\"width: 336px; height: 57px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p>Thus correct order of spin only magnetic moment is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
